meta {
  name: Search Patients by Information
  type: http
  seq: 24
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/patients
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~patientKey: PAPI-123456789012
  firstName: Calvin
  lastName: Hills
  phoneNumber: 5557578394
  dateOfBirth: 1989-08-16
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  > **Deprecated:** Supplying search criteria in the request body will be removed in a future release. Use query parameters instead.

  Searches for patients using the supplied demographic criteria. Returned patient IDs can be used with `GET /patients/{patientId}` to retrieve complete patient information. If no patient matches, the response contains an empty patient ID and an explanatory message.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `patientKey` | Patient Key. |
  | `firstName` | First name of the patient. |
  | `lastName` | Last name of the patient. |
  | `phoneNumber` | Phone number of the patient, digits only. |
  | `dateOfBirth` | Date of birth of the patient, in `YYYY-MM-DD` format. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
  [
    {
      "partnerPatientId": "bb46cabf-e703-81fc-2655-d5117fe186d2",
      "patientKey": "PAPI-123456789012",
      "firstName": "Martha",
      "middleName": "Sara",
      "lastName": "Rangel",
      "genderName": "female",
      "dateOfBirth": "1970-03-10",
      "phoneNumber": "7175501675",
      "addressLine1": "4990 HOOVER RD",
      "addressLine2": "APT 227",
      "city": "GROVE CITY",
      "state": "OH",
      "postalCode": "43123",
      "primaryLanguage": "english"
    },
    {
      "partnerPatientId": "49dbb5b3-ad7c-65ff-6e23-b53475af72bb",
      "patientKey": "PAPI-123456789012",
      "firstName": "Martha",
      "middleName": "Sara",
      "lastName": "Rangel",
      "genderName": "female",
      "dateOfBirth": "1970-03-10",
      "phoneNumber": "7175501675",
      "addressLine1": "4990 HOOVER RD",
      "addressLine2": "APT 227",
      "city": "GROVE CITY",
      "state": "OH",
      "postalCode": "43123",
      "primaryLanguage": "english"
    }
  ]
  ```
}
